{"speciesId":5,"names":{"fr":"Reptincel","es":"Charmeleon","en":"Charmeleon","ja":"リザード"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the temperature to unbearably high levels."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the temperature to unbearably high levels."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Tough fights could excite this POKéMON. When excited, it may blow out bluish- white flames."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is very hot­ headed by nature, so it constantly seeks opponents. It calms down only when it wins."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It has a barbaric nature. In battle, it whips its fiery tail around and slashes away with sharp claws."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"If it becomes agitated during battle, it spouts intense flames, incinerating its surroundings."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CHARMELEON mercilessly destroys its foes using its sharp claws. If it encounters a strong foe, it turns aggressive. In this excited state, the flame at the tip of its tail flares with a bluish white color."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"CHARMELEON mercilessly destroys its foes using its sharp claws. If it encounters a strong foe, it turns aggressive. In this excited state, the flame at the tip of its tail flares with a bluish white color."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Without pity, its sharp claws destroy foes. If it encounters a strong enemy, it becomes agitated, and the flame on its tail flares with a bluish white color."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lashes about with its tail to knock down its foe. It then tears up the fallen opponent with sharp claws."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the air temperature to unbearably high levels."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"In the rocky mountains where CHARMELEON live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"In the rocky mountains where CHARMELEON live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"In the rocky mountains where CHARMELEON live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is very hotheaded by nature, so it constantly seeks opponents. It calms down only when it wins."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has a barbaric nature. In battle, it whips its fiery tail around and slashes away with sharp claws."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La nuit, la queue ardente du Reptincel brille comme une étoile dans son repaire montagneux."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La nuit, la queue ardente du Reptincel brille comme une étoile dans son repaire montagneux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se sert de sa queue pour faire tomber ses adversaires. Une fois qu’ils sont au sol, il les lacère de ses griffes acérées."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Suele usar la cola para derribar a su rival. Cuando lo tira, se vale de sus afiladas garras para acabar con él."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lashes about with its tail to knock down its foe. It then tears up the fallen opponent with sharp claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"尻尾を 振り回して 相手を なぎ倒し 鋭い ツメで ズタズタに ひきさいてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"En agitant sa queue, il peut élever la température à un niveau incroyable."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando balancea la ardiente cola, eleva la temperatura a niveles muy altos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the air temperature to unbearably high levels."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"燃える 尻尾を 振り回すと まわりの 温度が どんどん 上がって 相手を 苦しめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Reptincel lacère ses ennemis sans pitié grâce à ses griffes acérées. S’il rencontre un ennemi puissant, il devient agressif et la flamme au bout de sa queue s’embrase et prend une couleur bleu clair."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Charmeleon no tiene reparo en acabar con su rival usando las afiladas garras que tiene. Si su enemigo es fuerte, se vuelve agresivo, y la llama que tiene en el extremo de la cola empieza a arder con mayor intensidad tornándose azulada."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Charmeleon mercilessly destroys its foes using its sharp claws. If it encounters a strong foe, it turns aggressive. In this excited state, the flame at the tip of its tail flares with a bluish white color."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"鋭い ツメで ようしゃなく たたきのめす。 強敵と 向かい合うと 気分が たかぶり 尻尾の 炎が 青白く 燃えあがる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Reptincel lacère ses ennemis sans pitié grâce à ses griffes acérées. S’il rencontre un ennemi puissant, il devient agressif et la flamme au bout de sa queue s’embrase et prend une couleur bleu clair."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Charmeleon no tiene reparo en acabar con su rival usando las afiladas garras que tiene. Si su enemigo es fuerte, se vuelve agresivo, y la llama que tiene en el extremo de la cola empieza a arder con mayor intensidad tornándose azulada."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Charmeleon mercilessly destroys its foes using its sharp claws. If it encounters a strong foe, it turns aggressive. In this excited state, the flame at the tip of its tail flares with a bluish white color."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鋭い ツメで ようしゃなく たたきのめす。 強敵と 向かい合うと 気分が たかぶり 尻尾の 炎が 青白く 燃えあがる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Exalté quand il affronte des adversaires puissants, ce Pokémon en vient parfois à cracher des flammes bleutées."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Librar combates intensos lo entusiasma tanto que en ocasiones lanza llamas de tono blanco azulado."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Tough fights could excite this Pokémon. When excited, it may breathe out bluish-white flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"強敵と 戦いつづけ エキサイトすると 青白い 炎を 吐き出すことがある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Exalté quand il affronte des adversaires puissants, ce Pokémon en vient parfois à cracher des flammes bleutées."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Librar combates intensos lo entusiasma tanto que en ocasiones lanza llamas de tono blanco azulado."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Tough fights could excite this Pokémon. When excited, it may breathe out bluish-white flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"強敵と 戦いつづけ エキサイトすると 青白い 炎を 吐き出すことがある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est très brutal. En combat, il se sert de ses griffes acérées et de sa queue enflammée pour mettre en pièces ses adversaires."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Este Pokémon de naturaleza agresiva ataca en combate con su cola llameante y hace trizas al rival con sus afiladas garras."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It has a barbaric nature. In battle, it whips its fiery tail around and slashes away with sharp claws."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"燃える しっぽを 振りまわし するどい ツメで 相手を 切り裂く 荒々しい 性格。"},{"